gametitle=TimeSplitters: Future Perfect (NTSC-U) [SLUS-21148] (FB2F4502)

[TSO Community Patch]
author=TSO Community
description=Team play for Shrink, Thief, Zones, Regeneration and Leech; Regeneration and Leech unlocked; team Bag Tag (shared team bag time); red, blue, yellow and green teams in TDM, Bag Tag, Shrink, Thief, Regeneration, Leech and Zones (local and LAN); yellow/green zone flames; Virus on Siberia; MapMaker per-item limits removed; alt-fire weapon versions, TNT, Time Grenade and Temporal Uplink in weapon lists; character select in MapMaker story maps; "Advanced Settings" page in match settings (Teamplay, Team Spawns, Disable Red/Blue/Yellow/Green Team, Disable Unarmed, Mercy Rule, Number of Flames, Respawn Delay).
